# What: Files Git must never track in the guide repository: dependencies, build output, archives,
#     local credentials and databases.
# Why: Definition of Done [CAP-S09] - no secrets committed; generated artefacts are rebuilt, not versioned.
# If missing or unlinked: node_modules, gen/ output, .mtar archives or credential files
#     (default-env.json, .env) can be committed by accident.
node_modules/
gen/
mta_archives/
*.mtar
default-env.json
.cdsrc-private.json
.env
.env.*
*.sqlite
*.db
coverage/
resources/
.DS_Store
*.log
tmp/
